      "english": "Force or weak-point Kotodama can beat weak foes...\fBut experienced fighters won't go down that easily.\fLook through your Gin Tama for useful Effect Gin Tama...\fMost foes have attack patterns. Watch, then turn them against them...\fNothing beats landing a strategy just right.",
